= Introduction

Deep learning has reshaped computer vision @lecun2015. Residual connections
enabled very deep networks to train reliably @he2016, and reinforcement learning
combined with search reached superhuman play in Go @silver2016. The transformer
architecture @attention2017 later generalized these gains to language.

= Method

We follow the residual design of @he2016 and optimise our model end to end.
